es2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp5.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01493000/RJ01492810_img_smp5_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "Escape The Cradle [AzureZero]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "text", "title": "『Escape The Cradle』は、狐っ娘の頭を撫でてHPを回復させながらがダンジョンを攻略するオートバトルRPG", "body": [{"intro": "特徴:<br />\r\n・撫でられる可愛いライブ2D狐っ娘！超可愛い！<br />\r\n・2～3時間でクリアできるシンプルなストーリー<br />\r\n・クリア済みステージで金策が可能なカジュアルなゲームプレイ<br />\r\n・2つの大型スキルツリー！<br />\r\n<br />\r\nストーリー<br />\r\n『Escape The Cradle』は、Cradleというダンジョン内で生まれた狐っ娘の物語。<br />\r\n彼女は自らと母を深淵から解放すべく戦う!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCradleは最下層で死亡した者を蘇生させる特殊なダンジョンだ。<br />\r\n誰が何の為に作ったのかは定かではない。しかし、世界の闇から我が子を守ろうとした女神の創造物だと推測する者もいる。<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEscape The Cradle is an autobattler RPG in which you send your foxgirl daughter to fight to clear the dungeon, and pet her head to restore her HP between dungeon runs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt has<br />\r\na cute live2d foxgirl to headpat! VERY CUTE!!<br />\r\na simple story that takes about 2-3 hours to complete.<br />\r\nthe ability to grind for money on stages you already beat, casual gameplay.<br />\r\n2 large skill trees!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSTORY<br />\r\nEscape The Cradle is the story of a foxgirl born inside a dungeon known as The Cradle.<br />\r\nShe fights to free herself and her mother from it's depths.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe cradle is a special dungeon that revives any that die inside at the bottom floor.<br />\r\nNo one knows for sure who created it, or what they created it for. but some suggest it was the creation of a goddess wanting to protect their child from the darkness of the world."}]}], "description": "狐っ娘の頭を撫でてHPを回復させながらがダンジョンを攻略するオートバトルRPG", "short_introduction": "狐っ娘の頭を撫でてHPを回復させながらがダンジョンを攻略するオートバトルRPG", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01492810.html", "site_id": "home", "fetched_at": 1794947444}